WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:05.960
Let's talk a little bit about the fact that
we still have a 100 year global pandemic going

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:11.580
on in the United States and many states are
improving, while many states are worsening

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:13.190
in terms of the spread.

00:00:13.190 --> 00:00:16.320
We will see what effect the protests have
on spread of the virus.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:18.160
It will take about 10 days to know.

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:19.160
Sure.

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:22.800
But I wanted to let you guys know something
that maybe won't will not surprise some of

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:28.520
you, which is that Dr. Anthony Foushee has
now confirmed that Donald Trump no longer

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:33.430
speaks to him very much and that he doesn't
speak to really any of the doctors on the

00:00:33.430 --> 00:00:35.120
Corona virus task force.

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:37.180
Now, why wouldn't this surprise you?

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:39.250
Well, if you know Trump, it wouldn't surprise
you.

00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:44.730
But five or six weeks ago, I came to you and
I said Donald Trump is now transitioning to

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:48.440
we are no longer going to talk about Corona
virus as a medical event.

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:51.340
We are no longer talking about corona virus
is a medical problem.

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:53.570
We're going to shift to we being Trump.

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:57.780
We're going to shift to roundtables with CEOs
about how much we're reopening and how many

00:00:57.780 --> 00:01:00.610
loans we've disbursed and yada, yada, yada.

00:01:00.610 --> 00:01:05.309
Dr. Anthony Foushee on the Corona Virus Task
Force is the top infectious disease doctor

00:01:05.309 --> 00:01:06.990
in the United States.

00:01:06.990 --> 00:01:10.560
And we as a country started to see less and
less of him weeks ago.

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:16.159
Dr. Foushee now has done a number of interviews
recently, and in one interview with STATT

00:01:16.159 --> 00:01:20.090
News said something incredibly revealing,
but not altogether shocking.

00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:26.039
Dr. Foushee was asked, does the president
talk to you about the vaccine work?

00:01:26.039 --> 00:01:28.810
Often, in fact, his answer was no.

00:01:28.810 --> 00:01:32.779
We used to have task force meetings every
single day, including Saturday and Sunday.

00:01:32.779 --> 00:01:38.060
And about 75 percent of the time after the
task force meeting, we would meet with the

00:01:38.060 --> 00:01:39.060
president.

00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:42.299
So I was meeting with him four times a week
back, a month or so ago.

00:01:42.299 --> 00:01:46.450
But as you probably noticed, that the task
force meetings have not occurred as often

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:47.450
lately.

00:01:47.450 --> 00:01:52.859
And certainly my meetings with the president
have been dramatically decreased.

00:01:52.859 --> 00:01:57.749
Now there are going to be right wingers and
Trampas who say this makes sense, this makes

00:01:57.749 --> 00:01:58.749
sense.

00:01:58.749 --> 00:01:59.920
The problem is going away.

00:01:59.920 --> 00:02:01.460
The problem being corona virus.

00:02:01.460 --> 00:02:04.099
So, of course, you have fewer meetings.

00:02:04.099 --> 00:02:07.179
The problem is that that's not based in reality.

00:02:07.179 --> 00:02:08.390
Look at the trend lines.

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:14.450
In the United States, cases and deaths have
slowly declined over a 10 week period.

00:02:14.450 --> 00:02:20.870
But we are often still finding 20000, 22000
new cases in a single day.

00:02:20.870 --> 00:02:26.900
In terms of deaths, fortunately, the trend
line is down, but we still regularly have

00:02:26.900 --> 00:02:31.020
fifteen hundred deaths in a single day from
Corona virus.

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:33.140
So nothing is over.

00:02:33.140 --> 00:02:38.290
This may end up merely being a warmup for
wave two in the fall, which could be even

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:39.290
worse.

00:02:39.290 --> 00:02:40.290
It could be not as bad.

00:02:40.290 --> 00:02:41.290
We don't know.

00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:43.970
We might not really even have a break between
the two waves.

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:50.060
And indeed, it seemed like the breaking point
for Donald Trump was that just disastrous,

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:55.620
shameful press briefing in April where Trump
wondered aloud about injecting bleach and

00:02:55.620 --> 00:02:59.250
rubbing alcohol into the body and the corona
virus.

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:02.210
Press briefings were already starting to wane
then, and now it's over.

00:03:02.210 --> 00:03:06.190
And Dr. Foushee has barely any contact with
Donald Trump.

00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:11.290
Now, there's some aspect of if I don't look
at it, if I don't talk about it, it doesn't

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:12.290
exist.

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:15.100
That's like a hear no evil, see no evil sort
of thing there.

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:17.830
This is kind of a weird direction to go.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:21.450
But there's something called object permanence
and child development.

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:23.100
People will know about this already.

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:27.200
And this is a big milestone for little kids
as babies develop.

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:33.210
There is a phase where if you take a ball
and you hide it, the baby doesn't know that

00:03:33.210 --> 00:03:35.240
the ball continues to exist.

00:03:35.240 --> 00:03:37.050
Even if you've hidden it behind your back.

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:42.400
And at some point, I can't believe this is
how we're analyzing a president at some point

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:44.450
in child development.

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:49.150
Developing children realize even if I can
no longer see the ball, the ball still exists.

00:03:49.150 --> 00:03:52.540
They can hold the idea of the ball in their
mind.

00:03:52.540 --> 00:03:56.390
And they continue to understand that just
because you don't see the ball doesn't mean

00:03:56.390 --> 00:03:58.760
it has disappeared from existence.

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:02.770
Trump's strategy is like that of a baby predevelopment
of object permanence.

00:04:02.770 --> 00:04:03.850
I won't talk about it.

00:04:03.850 --> 00:04:05.210
I won't look at it.

00:04:05.210 --> 00:04:06.459
It's like it doesn't exist.

00:04:06.459 --> 00:04:08.350
And Trump had this idea pretty early on.

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:11.600
Remember, with testing, Trump knew early on.

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:14.110
If we do more testing, we're gonna find more
cases.

00:04:14.110 --> 00:04:16.039
Let's keep our case numbers low.

00:04:16.039 --> 00:04:17.810
By not doing a lot of testing.

00:04:17.810 --> 00:04:19.579
That, of course, backfired.

00:04:19.579 --> 00:04:25.069
So then we get to a separate question, which
is, does Trump even believe experts who come

00:04:25.069 --> 00:04:29.460
to him with information that he admittedly
doesn't even want to be given?

00:04:29.460 --> 00:04:30.460
Not really.

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:35.710
Donald Trump believes he knows more than his
generals and his doctors and more than anybody.

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:41.319
So the benefit to meeting with the experts
is limited by the fact that Trump thinks he

00:04:41.319 --> 00:04:43.279
knows more than them anyway.

00:04:43.279 --> 00:04:48.539
But regardless, Dr. Anthony Foushee no longer
getting much face time with Donald Trump.

00:04:48.539 --> 00:04:49.800
Not a big surprise.

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:54.930
I would love it if Dr. Foushee did regular
briefings himself.

00:04:54.930 --> 00:04:59.080
I wouldn't even be opposed to the CDC being
part of them, like Dr. Redfield.

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:00.569
I know he's kind of a Trump tool.

00:05:00.569 --> 00:05:04.460
But without Trump hovering in the background,
hinge forward at the hips and swiveling, as

00:05:04.460 --> 00:05:07.460
he often does during during the briefings
up.

00:05:07.460 --> 00:05:12.219
I think Dr. Foushee and Dr. Redfield together
could give us a lot of really valuable information.

00:05:12.219 --> 00:05:16.909
Berk's, you know, remains a question mark
in terms of her just blind loyalty to Donald

00:05:16.909 --> 00:05:17.909
Trump.

00:05:17.909 --> 00:05:20.210
But it would be great to do it like other
countries do it.

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:21.610
Get the politicians out.

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:24.050
Let's get a briefing from medical experts.

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:25.050
Period.

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:27.360
We're not getting that either, unfortunately.

